{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.haruki.books",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "书店里她挑杂志挑了很久",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.haruki.books",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.haruki.books",
    "idolId": "haruki",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "text": "商业街的大书店。她在杂志区站了很久，三本抱在手里换来换去。",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "嗯──……",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "对、对不起，制作人先生，我挑太久了……",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不会，慢慢挑。──买哪本都行吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "要说能看到现在整个音乐圈的话，应该是这本……",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "这本给偶像留的版面好像很多……",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "这本有个我特别在意的特集，可是只为这个买又有点……",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "全买的话会破产呢…………",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………那，我买这本吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "诶？",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我看完可以借给你。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "那怎么好意思……可是……",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "没关系，我自己也想读了。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我买两本，はるき买这边一本，怎么样？",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "可、可以吗……？",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。你那本好看的话，也讲给我听。",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "好，一定……！",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "text": "结账的队伍很长。出了店门，她说要带路去一家有推荐的奶茶店。",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "这、这边！",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "制作人先生，我找到座位了！",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哦，谢谢。",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "不会，书还是您帮我拿的……",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈，没什么。那，喝はるき推荐的奶茶吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "嘿嘿……希望合您口味──",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "不，一定会合的！来，请请请～",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我开动了……！",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，好喝……！",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "对吧……！明明是甜的，却滑溜溜地就进去了……！",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "……呼，走累的身体太舒服了～",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──真悠闲啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "──咖啡馆是好，可是人一多，就听不见制作人先生的声音了……",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "外面宽敞一点、能好好说话的环境，是不是更好……",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "您教了我那么多书和杂志，虽然算不上回礼──",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "我也想和您分享这杯好喝的奶茶",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，谢谢。是个好主意。",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "────买来的那些，你其实很想读吧？摊开看看？",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "啊，不过……再等一下可以吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "38"
      },
      "38": {
        "id": "38",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "我想就这样，先聊一会儿。难得制作人先生也在。",
        "nextNodeId": "39"
      },
      "39": {
        "id": "39",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这样啊──那就这样吧。天气也不错。"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
